Not covered

The MIT License above applies to the source code only. It does not apply to
the following, which are not licensed for any use:

1. Images and other media. Every image file in this repository, including
   reproductions of paintings and photographs (for example
   e2e/assets/council-beach.jpg), the portrait in public/james.jpg, the
   screenshots in e2e/__screenshots__ and design_handoff_booking_page/, and
   any image the site displays. The paintings, photographs and portrait are
   © James Portman. All rights reserved.

2. Written content. The biography and other prose on the site's pages, and
   the titles and descriptions of works in data/ (products.ts,
   photographs.ts, making-of.ts, merchandise.ts, giftShop.ts).
   © James Portman. All rights reserved.

3. Names and identity. "Georgian Bay Artists", "georgianartist.com", the name
   James Portman, and the contact details, accounts and analytics ID in
   data/siteConfig.ts. A fork may reuse the code, but must replace these
   with its own and must not present itself as this site or this artist.
   FORKING.md explains how.

